# writeAgent). This entry's one command is a Replace-mode MoveTo with an
# always-empty OrderQueue, so the byte-layout change is the only difference:
# the 24 ticks and 78 domain events are unchanged. Prior re-pin: TASK-037
# (Canonical.FormatVersion 7 -> 8, PlayerIntent.Suppress /
# DecisionReason.TargetNotKnown added inside the already-canonical Order /
# Disposition sections).
